# AG Grid Theme Standard

## Rule
All list screens with AG Grid MUST use `AgGridShell` from `src/shared/ui/AgGridShell.tsx`.

## Forbidden
- Raw `AgGridReact` without `AgGridShell` wrapper (or `AgGridTheme` for special cases).
- Custom table renderers for list screens (AntD Table, HTML table) without explicit architectural decision.
- Hardcoded light background on grid containers.
- Importing only `ag-theme-quartz.css` without using theme-aware wrapper (dark theme will not apply).

## Required
- Import `ag-grid.css` and `ag-theme-quartz.css` (contains light + dark variants).
- Use `AgGridShell` for all grid-based list screens (Contracts, Orders, Margin, Countries, etc.).
- Grid must switch theme when Light/Dark toggle changes (no refresh).
- Page content area: use `Layout.Content` with `className="app-content"` for dark theme parity.

## Reference
- `src/shared/ui/AgGridShell.tsx` — standard wrapper (theme + app-grid).
- `src/shared/ui/AgGridTheme.tsx` — lower-level theme wrapper (used by AgGridShell).
- `App.css` — `[data-theme="dark"] .app-content` for dark background.
